  "goal": "The Squirrel's universal Time AI (Docs/AI_SYSTEM/AI_PLAN.md step time-arcade): ONE Skim Race policy that races all four intensities well, instead of a file per track. Its first generation is the three genomes the game ships (the general policy, the I1 file, the I2 file) and mutations of each; the loss is the four tracks' tuneall scores together (mean + 0.5 x the worst). Measured 2026-11-02, 6 races a track: the general policy scores 5.46 (I1 2.47, I2 2.89, I3 4.56, I4 2.79; I3 is raced at 2.7x ideal), the I1 file 8.36, the I2 file 7.40, and what the game flies today (each intensity's file where it fits) 5.47. The winner is the Squirrel Regatta is searched against (step time-arena-course).",
