  "plan": "regatta-balance",
  "plan_step": "time-arcade",
  "promote": "A PROPOSAL for the AI owner (Yash), any of the core four approving: race the team's best against each shipped genome on 20 FRESH races per intensity (seedbase 99000, tuneall's conditions); keep it only if it finishes as many as the best of them on every intensity and its composite is lower. Then it becomes the general policy: its genome's POLICIES block in Tools/Build/author_skimrace_ai_config.py with the searched fields over it and a bumped PolicyVersion, regenerated with that script and both --checks, never by hand. The per-intensity files stay until it beats each one on its own track; retiring them is Yash's call (AI_PLAN.md decision 1). It is then the Squirrel in the Regatta course searches (their `after`), and the editor check goes in Docs/UNITY_VERIFICATION_CHECKLIST.md.",
